                ? source.lastPathComponent + sentence.dropFirst(copyName.count) : sentence
    /// converted the file but the policy is `ask`, which a call never asks
    /// (spec §11 MC-5); nil otherwise. Both refusals that would have gone on
    /// to the ffmpeg step count: AVFoundation's (`ImportError`) and, for a
